From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:19:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: fold map loads only for tagged loads (a92c222bca, crbug
 585625644); cache epoch 40

[M159] Turboshaft fix from V8 15.9.128.29, not merged to 15.6 yet.
MachineOptimizationReducer::ReduceLoad constant-folded any offset-0 load
on a HeapObject constant into its map, even raw or untagged loads left in
unreachable code. The String length guard is not carried: 15.6 has no
such fold. Adds the mjsunit test wasm/turboshaft/regress-585625644.js and
raises kFlyWebCacheEpoch 39 -> 40 for the release after 3.2.1. Notes in
patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
